Comment: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Nineteenth Episode\NThe Magic Pen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:01:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Next!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.21,0:02:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.35,0:02:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All five hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't hit the center, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.32,0:02:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.80,0:02:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.02,0:02:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All five right in the center!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.39,0:02:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones in the center aren't mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.84,0:02:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be... hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Who goes there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to meet you somewhere alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Feisty as ever, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.84,0:03:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You tomboy princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, I'm a prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to hide it from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.36,0:03:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.94,0:03:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what anyone says, a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, isn't this a pen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bring random stuff into this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, just take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Paper and ink!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.39,0:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're a boy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.22,0:03:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then write Sapphire is a boy right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.49,0:03:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.71,0:03:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a magical pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:03:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, write what I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sapphire is a boy."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You meant to write "Sapphire is a boy," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But take a close look at what you wrote!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sapphire is a girl!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.66,0:04:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.38,0:04:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You wrote {\i1}girl{\i0} yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.66,0:04:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.59,0:04:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wrote {\i1}boy{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.00,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sapphire is a boy..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.88,0:04:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sapphire is a girl!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.76,0:04:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I keep writing {\i1}girl{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.28,0:04:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you {\i1}are{\i0} a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, a great doctor gave me that magic pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't write lies with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.43,0:04:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the biggest liar can only write the truth with that pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.18,0:04:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Sapphire, you're really charming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.78,0:04:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so spunky, and you're just as tough as any boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.34,0:04:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, you have such a kind heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So kind, so very kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.58,0:04:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fact that you don't even realize it just makes you all the more charming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:05:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask of that kind Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to give that mysterious pen to the flaxen-haired girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.87,0:05:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A flaxen-haired girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How she really feels!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.97,0:05:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,About the carnival where I danced with that flaxen-haired girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Young Franz... Is Sapphire that flaxen-haired girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the favor of a lifetime!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the flaxen-haired girl and tell her to write a letter with this pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.81,0:05:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you look for her and ask her yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.78,0:05:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My uncle's been breathing down my neck lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I barely managed to sneak out of the castle today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.56,0:05:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz, you're making things very difficult for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sneaking off to play in the neighboring kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They found me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Sapphire, I'm counting on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.50,0:06:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.07,0:06:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, hiding in the secret room again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.43,0:06:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressing up like a girl right about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, Lord Sapphire is actually a girl, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.43,0:07:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Franz still hasn't figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.27,0:07:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll write a letter to Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}From the girl with the flaxen hair{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.88,0:07:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is writing all by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.00,0:07:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The true identity of the girl with the flaxen hair is Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl with the flaxen hair is a little bit in love with Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, this is embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't send a letter like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:29.10,SIGN - 19 magic pen - sapphire's letter on face,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(315.26,400)}The prince is strong. \NThe princess is a woman.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This really is a strange pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! It'd be fun to see what's on other people's minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.68,0:07:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Nanny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Up to mischief again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.68,0:07:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just write whatever comes to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.96,0:07:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"Lord Sapphire goes too far with his mischief, so I can't stand him."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.34,0:08:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}May Lord Sapphire grow up healthy and strong.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.11,0:08:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just write down whatever is on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then: "Prince Sapphire is a splendid prince."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,"Long live Silverland!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what was on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gum, chocolate, juice, and ice cream{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.55,0:08:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be really hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.53,0:08:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.86,0:08:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.84,0:08:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.49,0:08:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That poor peacock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.05,0:08:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We must treat animals with kindness, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So I won't forget, could you write that down here for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.48,0:08:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.13,0:09:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"Let us treat animals with kindness."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.73,0:09:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.87,0:09:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'll secretly kill this peacock and use it as a hat decoration."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, did I write that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing what people are really thinking is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Though everyone thinks such awful things despite how they look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.91,0:09:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,he's the one whose mind I want to read the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.66,0:09:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Prince Sapphire, what brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking about right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.82,0:09:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.67,0:09:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wishing for Prince Sapphire to grow up strong and for Silverland
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.43,0:09:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,to prosper even more. Just something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.20,0:09:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Lord Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.61,0:09:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Write those words down right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.15,0:09:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.59,0:09:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yes, scribble, scribble, scribble..."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:09:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, the rest is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.52,0:10:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sapphire must be a girl."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"Someday I'll rip off her mask..."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.84,0:10:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't write anything like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.93,0:10:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, I really don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.76,0:10:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"Tonight at midnight." That's as far as you wrote!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.22,0:10:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth is happening at midnight tonight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I really have no...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.30,0:10:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.37,0:10:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.53,0:10:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait either!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I said wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.56,0:10:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.86,0:10:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.98,0:10:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, welcome, Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin, what are you planning to do at midnight tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Write your answer on paper with this pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I shall tell you out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.38,0:11:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just make up lies out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.02,0:11:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Write it with this pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I have an injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Then write with your left hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.10,0:11:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My left hand is also, unfortunately... As I said, I'll answer out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.75,0:11:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can say whatever you want out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.38,0:11:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear your lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, what a pain to bring out a magic pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait, it's a wonderful pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, even Sapphire won't be able to lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure she writes "I am a woman".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.67,0:11:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant as always, Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what about our plan for midnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course we're going through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be even more fun than the original plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One hour left until midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.16,0:12:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are they up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How many minutes are left?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.82,0:12:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.13,0:12:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get out of here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like they were waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, douse it with water!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.03,0:13:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting out the fire comes first... Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.27,0:13:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't even bring water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.89,0:13:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they're using the fire as cover to search my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.88,0:13:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of fire brigade doesn't bring water?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Interfering with firefighting is a serious crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.22,0:13:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fake firefighters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want this place to burn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.76,0:13:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame us if the castle turns to ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.32,0:13:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's spreading!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.62,0:13:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.06,0:13:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How troublesome. Just leave it to us—or this axe might fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who started the fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:13:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You've shown your true colors!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.09,0:14:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.02,0:14:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.28,0:14:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.46,0:14:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire brigade is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.15,0:14:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No water's coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.22,0:14:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Garigori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.72,0:14:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.16,0:14:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's someone I can't bring myself to say, lend me paper and a pen. I'll write their name down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's make them write it with the magic pen.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.86,0:15:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.36,0:15:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Write it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.45,0:15:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.09,0:15:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you guys can be useful once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.70,0:15:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.24,0:15:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's as good as ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I'll definitely tear off Sapphire's mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Does it still hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.73,0:15:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mr. Garigori's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.99,0:15:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a fire in Sapphire's room yesterday, so I rushed right over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.66,0:15:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And then Sapphire passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.40,0:15:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you took care of me the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.71,0:16:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my secret room okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. No one will ever find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.44,0:16:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.23,0:16:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that thief go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what happened to the pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.65,0:16:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's something you were holding onto for Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.56,0:16:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.24,0:16:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It was stolen during the fire last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.82,0:16:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a real problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at them moving all those desks and chairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.43,0:16:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.60,0:16:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they preparing for anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.10,0:16:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.49,0:16:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know the details, but it's supposedly a ceremony for the Prince's Oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.05,0:16:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince's Oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.46,0:16:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince's Oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.56,0:16:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince's Oath, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.12,0:16:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.64,0:17:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ceremony where the prince writes down and proclaims an oath to devote his life to the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, it hasn't been performed in nearly 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This ceremony was abolished two centuries ago, so why bring it back so suddenly...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.62,0:17:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.77,0:17:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin is waiting for you in the main hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.65,0:17:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only told that he wishes to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.50,0:17:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.00,0:17:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with all these over-the-top preparations?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, why do I have to take the Prince's Oath anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, this is an important ancient ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,On this paper, you write: "I am without a doubt the prince of this realm."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.34,0:17:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"From now on, I shall serve this kingdom as its prince."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That is all you must write.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.87,0:17:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Using that pen right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.10,0:18:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, what a strange pen...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,, Is something wrong, Prince Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.61,0:18:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hate making such a big fuss over something so obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, your father approved of this ritual himself and stamped it with his official seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.87,0:18:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse, we'll make you do it by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It starts right at noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I use that pen, it'll definitely write "Sapphire is a woman"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know! Maybe Prince Franz can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't be able to do a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.81,0:18:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, there are only two hours left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do it! I'll go to the neighboring kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.55,0:18:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.87,0:18:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll never make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,One hour left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.39,0:19:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to escort you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.58,0:19:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Escort?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It is time, Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.51,0:19:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Great Hall, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.82,0:19:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what an oddball.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, please take that seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.34,0:19:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Throwing a tantrum during such an important ceremony is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.35,0:19:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But... what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.46,0:20:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're awfully reserved for a prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.87,0:20:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, hurry and take your seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please take the pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.78,0:20:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and write!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hesitating will only make them suspect you're a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together. Sapphire, take the pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.47,0:20:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, fly faster, Oowashi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.11,0:20:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.56,0:20:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time left!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.64,0:20:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see it! The castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oowashi-san, pull up to that window!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.67,0:20:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Prince Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there some reason you can't take the oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.22,0:21:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a girl, so stop dragging your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.73,0:21:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's no use...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.01,0:21:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire has the pen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.41,0:21:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.26,0:21:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Times like this are when you should act like a man and knock 'em dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't think of any good ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.73,0:21:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I go make a scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.95,0:21:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.08,0:21:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.79,0:22:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Blanco, and I travel the world picking fights!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Prince Sapphire is pretty strong in this kingdom, so I came to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.68,0:22:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.76,0:22:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Seize this fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.26,0:22:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.71,0:22:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun. Let's do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone gets in the way of this fight, they'll regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, why did this guy have to butt in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.11,0:22:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.58,0:22:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you tomboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Prince Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.75,0:22:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.78,0:22:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.07,0:22:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Let me at 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.05,0:23:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on! Had enough already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.12,0:23:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.50,0:23:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can sleep soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.55,0:23:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, that strange pen of yours caused quite a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.55,0:23:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry. I won't rely on something like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.50,0:23:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Franz, people say one thing and mean another, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.08,0:24:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I wonder if that flaxen-haired girl lies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.70,0:24:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sure she's the one who tells the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.16,0:24:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll meet her soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.02,0:24:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You reached her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.51,0:24:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He still hasn't noticed.
